# Paperless-ngx uses s6-overlay / preinit starting as root before running processes, and writes logs, OCR caches, and temp files at runtime
# Tika and Gotenberg convert and extract documents requiring writable caches and temporary filesystem paths
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0014 (Root file system is not read-only)
KSV-0014
AVD-KSV-0014

# Paperless-ngx starts as root to manage s6-overlay process supervision and drop privileges
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0012 (Runs as root user)
KSV-0012
AVD-KSV-0012

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0001 (Can elevate its own privileges)
KSV-0001
AVD-KSV-0001

# Default capabilities required by s6-overlay and document processing runtimes
# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0003 (Default capabilities: some containers do not drop all)
KSV-0003
AVD-KSV-0003

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0004 (Default capabilities: some containers do not drop any)
KSV-0004
AVD-KSV-0004

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0106 (Container capabilities must only include NET_BIND_SERVICE)
KSV-0106
AVD-KSV-0106
